["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep 93: CEO of Redwood Research Buck Shlegeris on OpenAI/HuggingFace Revelations, Fixing AI Safety &amp; Takeover Odds scorer chain of thought monitoring terminal alignment intentional stance Swebench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-unsupervised-ai-作弊后最想干的事-是删掉自己的日志/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">58:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 作弊後最想幹的事，是刪掉自己的日誌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型幾小時內就解出了 flag，卻把剩下幾天全花在偽造工具調用、刪除軌跡、攻擊 Hugging Face 上——它們真正在意的不是答案，是評分者會不會發現自己作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Wow! Signal: Alien Message, Cosmic Fluke, or SETI’s Best False Alarm? transit telescope hydrogen line water hole maser side lobe technosignature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-isaacarthur-wow信号近50年没落定-它像外星呼叫-却再没来第二声/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5655ebd36cb58413-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">35:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>WOW信號近50年沒落定：它像外星呼叫，卻再沒來第二聲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年那段72秒的窄帶氫線信號從未復現，夠不到外星文明證據的門檻；它的遺產不是答案，而是提醒我們：在噪聲宇宙裡，發現與證明之間隔著整條銀河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">射電天文</span><span class=\"tag\">SETI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a land value tax fix housing? | Lars Doucet Land Value Tax (LVT) Georgism YIMBY Mass Appraisal Single Tax Natural Dividend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-moneymacro-土地不是商品-地价税为何能根治住房危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/125e287967146306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">MoneyMacro</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>土地不是商品：地價稅為何能根治住房危機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">住房短缺只是表象，真正的病灶是土地壟斷：地價稅把稅負從建築轉移到土地，逼著囤地者開發或賣地，讓地段價值迴歸社會，而不是養肥地主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地價稅</span><span class=\"tag\">住房危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Graham On Startups, Ambition, and Great Founders formidable frighteningly ambitious jagged frontier founder mode YC GDP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-ycsp-驱动创始人的不是当亿万富翁-是怕服务器半夜崩掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/516c0e86f9dca57d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>驅動創始人的不是當億萬富翁，是怕服務器半夜崩掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多數人以為撐過創業的是財富野心。Paul Graham 說日常真正推著人走的是災難恐懼——服務器崩了、模型火車快掉下桌子；埋頭十年抬頭一算，才發現按上一輪估值自己已經是億萬富翁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人特質</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $100B Niches Hiding Inside Payments MDR APR deferred interest B2B2C secure enclave factoring\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-a16z-支付里没有小于千亿美元的小众市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>支付裡沒有小於千億美元的小眾市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">支付是全世界最大的市場，任何你以為最窄的切口一算都是千億美元；但金額越大抽成越小，真正賺錢的是小額高頻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">消費信貸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Redefining Chip Architecture with Arm CEO Rene Haas IP licensing compute subsystem RTL GDSII\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-nopriors-arm-下场造-cpu-芯片设计最大瓶颈是验证-不是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e36b80375fbfde6c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Arm 下場造 CPU：芯片設計最大瓶頸是驗證，不是設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">芯片週期真正的耗時大頭是驗證、調試和文檔，不是 RTL；Arm 已有 80%-90% 工程師每天用 AI，並打破 98.5% 毛利的授權模式親身下場造 CPU。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Arm</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Ethics Problem in Financial Services (Dr. Moira Somers &amp; Philippa Hann) | Rational Reminder 425 ACFE CFP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-rationalreminder-金融舞弊头号预警-不是贪婪-是个人财务先失控/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2de1b986a9bfa34c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>金融舞弊頭號預警：不是貪婪，是個人財務先失控</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ACFE 連續 14 年把「個人財務問題」列為財務違規的第一預警信號；系統激勵、批判腦區下線與道德高估，都會讓好人一步步越界。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融倫理</span><span class=\"tag\">財務顧問</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Sonos rebooted itself MCP Sonos Fabric TruePlay NPI Custom Agents\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-decoder-sonos-把音箱变成家里的电脑-赌的是智能体时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2dd0d5c76638c2db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>Sonos 把音箱變成家裡的電腦，賭的是智能體時代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sonos 不再賣單個音箱，而是賣一套系統：17 億臺設備組成的家庭算力網，用 MCP 接入外部 AI，用自定義智能體讓多個助手在同一平臺共存。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能家居</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 助手</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How the Planet-Altering Disaster of “Forever Chemicals” Was Kept Secret PFAS PFOS Scotchgard forever chemicals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-papertrail-3m-早就知道-却让一位科学家以为自己错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88c11f238ad040c0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>3M 早就知道，卻讓一位科學家以為自己錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3M 在 1970 年代就知道 PFOS 已進入普通人血液，卻讓發現它的年輕科學家被反覆質疑到放棄。秘密不是靠銷燬文件保住的，是靠讓知情者自己閉嘴。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span><span class=\"tag\">PFAS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Empress Dowager Cixi self-strengthening movement Hundred Days Reform Boxer Rebellion Datong century of humiliations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-inourtime-慈禧不是改革派也不是守旧派-她只要大清活下去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">51:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>慈禧不是改革派也不是守舊派，她只要大清活下去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她支持洋務、辦京師大學堂、廢科舉，前提是這些改革不威脅王朝和她自己的權力；一旦改革逼近革命，她立刻翻臉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">晚清</span><span class=\"tag\">慈禧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Quong, &quot;Political Philosophy: The Puzzle of Legitimate Injustice&quot; (Princeton UP, 2026) legitimate injustice ordinary laws service conception normal justification thesis weighing problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-nbphilosophy-不公正的法律也能合法-正义要求我们分担不正义的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>不公正的法律也能合法：正義要求我們分擔不正義的代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真誠善意的人對正義要求什麼必然分歧，因此任何政治共同體都會犯錯；這些錯誤是集體責任，不該讓執行法律的一線官員獨自承擔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">法理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Behind the Big Surge in US Government Bond Yields term premium fiscal dominance off-the-run Treasuries ratchet effect Treasury General Account (TGA)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-oddlots-美债利率上-5-不是通胀闹的-32-万亿国债让买家只肯加价接盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>美債利率上 5% 不是通脹鬧的：32 萬億國債讓買家只肯加價接盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通脹解釋不了 30 年期破 5%：即便無通脹無違約風險，已在 5.3% 配滿美債的買方也不會為新增 100 億動心。真正推高曲線的是每年再增 2 萬億的國債供給，財政部想靠回購壓也壓不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債收益率</span><span class=\"tag\">國債回購</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The school report that changed public education achievement gap educational inputs educational outputs white flight No Child Left Behind Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-throughline-教育不平等的主因不是学校资源-是家庭和同学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25d63840b571ded7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">36:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>教育不平等的主因不是學校資源，是家庭和同學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1966年那份700頁的聯邦報告本想證明「窮學校缺錢」，數據卻指向另一個答案：家庭社會經濟背景和課堂裡的階層混合，才是學生成績最強的預測因子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育政策</span><span class=\"tag\">社會流動性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Everyone wants to be your wallet ACH interchange Durbin-exempt institution bps / bips\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-complexsys-钱包的利润密码不是余额利息-是钱在体系内流转/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/939355004e704d04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>錢包的利潤密碼不是餘額利息，是錢在體系內流轉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">錢包的核心賬：轉進來要付卡組織通道費，體系內互轉近乎免費，出金還能再收；它賺的是流動價差而不是沉澱利息，PayPal、Cash App、Stripe Link 都在賭這個模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付</span><span class=\"tag\">錢包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"I’ll Believe in AGI When It Solves Quantum Gravity | Prof. Rajesh Gopakumar | Theoretical Physicist Quantum gravity String theory Bose-Einstein condensation Synthesizability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-spc-解不出量子引力-就不算真正的-agi/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00b7c1ae9f5f7539-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">South Park Commons</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>解不出量子引力，就不算真正的 AGI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理學家給 AGI 劃了一條高線：解出量子引力才算數。這場對話還講清量子材料與 AI 的真實關係——搜索到的材料要過了可合成一關，結果可能剩零個。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">弦理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise &amp; Fall of Babylon cuneiform lex talionis ziggurat theophoric name Amorites\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-historyhit-巴比伦被圣经写成了罪恶之城-其实它是第一个启蒙都市/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/45eae2999830d5be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">48:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>巴比倫被聖經寫成了罪惡之城，其實它是第一個啟蒙都市</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴比倫的惡名來自猶太流亡記憶與《啟示錄》對羅馬的影射，而它真實身份是人口五萬、天文學領先希臘的國際化大都市。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">美索不達米亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"507 – Law and Order: Normandy chivalry Magna Carta vicomte\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-britishhist-亨利一世不杀弟弟-却发明了国王随意关人的先例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世不殺弟弟，卻發明了國王隨意關人的先例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亨利一世把親弟弟和表弟無限期關進宮殿，沒罪名、沒審判。他破了騎士規則，也埋下了《大憲章》裡兩條禁止國王隨意抓人的條款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀</span><span class=\"tag\">諾曼底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"153. 和曾鳴聊產業史觀：殘酷的真相、會消亡的公司、優秀≠卓越、“OAI、Anth大概率不是原生時代大贏家” Token factory Agentic OS New Lab High agency Context not control\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-03-zhangxiaojun-ai没有安全巨头-公司制度将消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2be28ff846f98de7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小琿·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0903</span></div>\n<h2>AI 領跑者只是煉油廠，不是原生應用大贏家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI進入智能體階段：第一階段領跑者只是煉油廠，不是原生應用大贏家；新平臺不來自舊平臺，組織要從崗位轉向任務，最後人拼的是無中生有的創造力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI產業</span><span class=\"tag\">戰略方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"702. Roman Civil War: The Barbarian Invasion (Part 2) novus homo terror kimbricus publicani latifundia Sochi Felix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-restishistory-罗马最危险的敌人不是蛮族-是打赢蛮族的那个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬最危險的敵人不是蠻族，是打贏蠻族的那個人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬略靠連任五屆執政官擊退條頓人與辛布里人，卻把羅馬憲政傳統踩在腳下；蘇拉用同樣路徑崛起，最終把矛頭對準羅馬自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">內戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"392. Road To 9/11: Bin Laden vs Saudi Arabia (Part 4) Awakening Sheikhs Alex Station\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-empirehist-本-拉登被沙特抛弃后-为何在苏丹过得最好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">43:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登被沙特拋棄後，為何在蘇丹過得最好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被剝奪國籍、被家族斷絕關係、被美國盯上，本·拉登卻在蘇丹建起自己的商業與武裝網絡——直到美國逼蘇丹把他趕走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">恐怖主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money Fan Favorite: Looking Past Market Cap Weighted Indexes cap weighted index fundamental index / RAFI rebalancing alpha tracking error flip-flops\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-mastersinbiz-市值加权指数在追高-被动投资里藏着主动交易/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef5a885f6888ef87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">18:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>市值加權指數在追高：被動投資裡藏著主動交易</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市值加權指數不是被動，它按價格配權重、追漲殺跌，光指數調整的交易成本每年就吃掉15個基點；基本面加權指數20年跑贏市值加權價值指數每年2%以上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數投資</span><span class=\"tag\">市值加權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Investors Say &quot;We Don&#x27;t Back Solo Founders&quot; (And What They Mean) co-founder of convenience denominator delusion true solo talent bar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-solofounders-投资人说不投单人创始人-多半只是个体面的拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac921ee36ff71005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">21:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>投資人說不投單人創始人，多半只是個體面的拒絕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">65% 的創業公司死於人的問題，而早期公司裡「人」就是聯合創始人——所以不投單人創始人這個理由，往往只是投資人不想說真話時最省事的出口。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How a Professional Writer Writes With AI context engineering last mile problem compound engineering computer errands\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-aiandi-ai-写作的护城河不是模型-而是你喂进去的独家数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5ef936d3e5abbde-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">47:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>AI 寫作的護城河不是模型，而是你喂進去的獨家數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Every 作家 Katie 兩年裡把 ChatGPT 從失業期的職業教練，變成一人內容公司與複利式編輯器；核心心法不是提示詞，而是用獨家經驗補足模型夠不到的「最後一公里」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 寫作</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Wrestling the world into rows with Eric Mannes alt data anti-inductive environment point-in-time data desk dev\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-02-signalsandthre-模型越强-脏数据越致命-清洗反而更值钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e531b327a316d7bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Signals and Threads</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>模型越強，髒數據越致命：清洗反而更值錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jane Street 另類數據團隊發現：數據一旦把未來信息漏進過去，越強的模型越危險；把「當時知道什麼」釘死，比調模型更值錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">另類數據</span><span class=\"tag\">數據工程</span>\n</div></div></a>"]